    <string name="about_body_html">Version 1.1.9&lt;br&gt;Copyright © 2026 Fairy Phoenix Foundation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This app records minute-level estimates of screen use, either on this device alone or across your devices, and reminds you to take breaks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Privacy:&lt;/b&gt; Your screen-use data remains on this device and, if enabled, in your chosen private-cloud account. STG does not send it to the developer or anyone else.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Accuracy:&lt;/b&gt; STG estimates screen use from Android activity signals, so its totals may differ from other system usage statistics.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Third-Party Software Acknowledgments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This app includes SQLite and open-source components from Android and Kotlin. Their original copyright notices and license terms are preserved. All rights remain with their respective owners. STG claims no ownership of these components.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html&quot;&gt;SQLite copyright and public-domain notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://source.android.com/docs/setup/about/licenses&quot;&gt;Android Open Source Project licenses&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/blob/master/license/README.md&quot;&gt;Kotlin license&lt;/a&gt;</string>
